{
  "$comment": [
    "Machine-readable requirements from docs/ui/handoff/AINTERCEPT_UI_HANDOFF.md, checked in CI (docs/ui/BUILD_PLAN.md §11).",
    "A requirement applies from the moment its file or route exists: an endpoint's scenarios once the route is implemented,",
    "a component's story states once its file exists, a test once every component it needs exists.",
    "Story export names match states case-insensitively, ignoring punctuation (state 'iconDisabled' = export IconDisabled).",
    "Change this file deliberately: it is the definition of done.",
    "Screens (src/screens/<Name>Screen) are pure and need a story per state; pages (src/pages/<Name>Page) only wire the API into their screen and need no story."
  ],
